<main id="top">

  <section class="section page-top">
    <div class="container legal-page">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 30 October 2026</p>

      <p>This policy explains what information Scrap Express ("we", "us") collects through our website <strong>scrap-express.onrender.com</strong> and the Scrap Express app, why we collect it, and the choices you have. We are a scrap buying and demolition business serving companies across Delhi NCR.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <h3>Information you give us</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Request details:</strong> company or organisation name, business type, contact person, phone number, email, GSTIN, site address, area, pincode, the scrap or building details, quantity and any notes you add.</li>
        <li><strong>Photos and videos</strong> you attach to a pickup or demolition request.</li>
        <li><strong>Your answers to quotes</strong> (accept or decline).</li>
        <li><strong>Rate updates:</strong> if you subscribe to daily rates and news, your email address or WhatsApp number.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>When you create an account</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>If you sign in with Google, we receive your name, email address and a Google account identifier through Google Firebase Authentication. We never see your Google password.</li>
        <li>The business details you save in My Account, used to fill in your next booking.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>When you turn on notifications</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>A notification token for your device, issued by your browser's push service (for example Google or Apple). It lets us send you alerts and contains no personal details.</li>
      </ul>
      <h3>Collected automatically</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>A cookie that keeps you signed in. We do not use advertising or analytics cookies.</li>
        <li>Basic technical logs (such as IP address, device/browser type and pages requested), kept by our hosting provider for security and troubleshooting.</li>
        <li>The app saves some of our own files (styles, images) on your device so it loads faster and works on a weak connection.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do <strong>not</strong> collect your location, contacts, or any payment card details, and we do not show ads.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To review your request, contact you, send you a quote and arrange the pickup or site visit.</li>
        <li>If you subscribed, to send you daily scrap rates and news about our services.</li>
        <li>To prepare GST invoices, weighbridge slips and payments.</li>
        <li>To show your requests and quotes in My Account and send the alerts you turned on.</li>
        <li>To keep our services secure and to meet legal and tax requirements.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your information. We share it only with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Service providers that run our service:</strong> Render (website hosting, database and file storage, in Singapore), Google Firebase (sign-in), Google Fonts (text fonts), browser push services (Google, Apple, Mozilla, Microsoft) to deliver notifications, Google (Gmail) to send emails, and Meta (WhatsApp) to send WhatsApp updates to numbers that subscribed.</li>
        <li><strong>Authorities</strong>, when the law requires it.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your account is kept until you delete it.</li>
        <li>Rate update subscriptions are kept until you unsubscribe.</li>
        <li>Records of requests, quotes and transactions are kept as long as Indian tax law requires (GST records are generally kept for at least 6 years), even after an account is deleted.</li>
        <li>Photos and videos are deleted when the request they belong to is deleted, or when you delete your account.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Security</h2>
      <p>Information is sent over an encrypted connection (HTTPS). Photos, videos and request details can only be viewed by our team through a password-protected dashboard.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Update</strong> your saved details any time in My Account.</li>
        <li><strong>Turn off notifications</strong> in My Account or in your phone's settings.</li>
        <li><strong>Stop rate updates</strong> with the unsubscribe link in any of our emails, by replying STOP on WhatsApp, or by asking us.</li>
        <li><strong>Delete your account</strong> from My Account, or see <a href="/delete-account">how to delete your account</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Ask us</strong> for a copy of your information or to correct it, using the contact details below.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Our service is for businesses and is not meant for anyone under 18.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>Scrap Express, Delhi NCR, India<br>
        Phone / WhatsApp: <a href="tel:+919818826333">+91 98188 26333</a><br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:scrapexpress@gmail.com">scrapexpress@gmail.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

